# Normalise committed build artefacts to LF. The TypeScript compiler always
# emits LF, but the checked-in trees were previously stored CRLF, so every
# rebuild flipped ~180 files (see PR #69). Pinning eol=lf here stops that
# line-ending churn from recurring.
/lib/** text eol=lf
/bundle-es5/** text eol=lf
/bundle-es2015/** text eol=lf
